{"id":44281,"imdb":"tt0090665","en":"Halfaouine: Boy of the Terraces","orig":"عصفور السطح","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"في حلفاوين ، وهو حي شعبي بتونس ، يتم مشاركة الشاب نورا (الذي يلعبه ابن أخي المخرج) بين عدة عوالم: عالم الرجال ، في الشوارع ، عالم النساء ، الذي لا يزال بإمكانه مشاركة الحمام رغم سن البلوغ , و من خياله مخاوف شديدة من المرور لحياة الكبار. يرسم بوغدير صورة سعيدة عن الحياة التونسية ويوضح العلاقات الدقيقة والمعقدة بين الرجال والنساء في تونس.","rd":"1990-09-14","rt":98,"g":[35,18],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Les Films du Scarabée","logo":null,"c":"FR"},{"n":"Cinétéléfilms","logo":"/zmB7hLD7n4Wxr7o3Vj9o9988vZB.png","c":"TN"},{"n":"France Média","logo":null,"c":""}],"countries":["FR","IT","TN"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"US","d":"1990-09-14"},{"c":"FR","d":"1990-09-26"}],"dir":["Férid Boughedir"],"prod":["Ahmed Baha Attia","Sylvain Bursztejn","Hassen Daldoul","Eliane Stutterheim"],"wri":["Férid Boughedir","Nouri Bouzid","Maryse León García"],"mus":["Anouar Brahem"],"dop":["Georges Barsky"],"cast":[{"n":"Selim Boughedir","ch":"Noura","p":"/rKTA1pltcjk5h1PF16AZHYCZrim.jpg"},{"n":"Rabia Ben Abdallah","ch":"Jamila, Noura's mother","p":"/waX9XSwWdOhSI6qwRAAqTucJVj4.jpg"},{"n":"Mustapha Adouani","ch":"Si Azzouz, Noura's father","p":"/1bjdJX8NQhpp5KDY2k1NvhatxpA.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Driss","ch":"Salih","p":"/lStjW7cD3kHclwIvij7yY98D5MI.jpg"},{"n":"Hélène Catzaras","ch":"Latifa","p":"/w24ed5djeLVqMqUO4z0v2mvvAiu.jpg"},{"n":"Fatima Ben Saïdane","ch":"Salouha","p":"/ofpPhmU9jaMdRUkoF4wkGVZYsC3.jpg"},{"n":"Carolyn Chelby","ch":"Leila","p":"/gML0FfuQ71Wgh39ry9uklEOwA0g.jpg"},{"n":"Abdelhamid Guayas","ch":"Sheikh Mokhtar","p":null},{"n":"Jamel Sassi","ch":"Moncef","p":"/sGRLjt5dInQpOHQHv8EziFfoBRf.jpg"},{"n":"Zahira Ben Ammar","ch":"The matron","p":"/jsLKMuK1ReXUIwljYDWrrfJy9s6.jpg"},{"n":"Radhouane El Meddeb","ch":"Mounir","p":null},{"n":"Jamila Ourabi","ch":"Owner of the hammam","p":null},{"n":"Aziza Boulabiar","ch":"Zekhia","p"